            <li>Pitch a card game with a loop, a twist, and an AI</li>
            <li>Break "hold a hand of cards" into parts small enough to look up one at a time, and say in one line what each part does</li>
            <li>Say which reference page or earlier lesson each part came from, and where you would reread it</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

